<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Endometrial cyst</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Endometrial</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: PT;\">Endometrial stroma</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: PT;\">CD10+, PR+, ER+</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&minus;</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Absent</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"141\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><strong>Intraductal papillary neoplasm</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\">Usually biliary, metaplastic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\">Fibrous</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\">+++</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\">Present</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"141\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Bile duct cyst</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Biliary</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Fibrous</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&minus;</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Absent</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"141\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><strong>Peribiliary cyst</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\">Biliary</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\">Fibrous</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\">&minus;/+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 113.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\">Absent</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"141\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210058666;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtex